# The appliance's name. bluetoothd takes the adapter name from the system
# hostname -- main.conf leaves `Name` commented -- so this is also what a phone
# sees when it scans for the board. The base Fenix rootfs shipped ubuntu-256,
# which is the build host's name and has no business on the device.
127.0.0.1	localhost
127.0.1.1	chiron
::1		localhost ip6-localhost ip6-loopback
ff02::1		ip6-allnodes
ff02::2		ip6-allrouters
